---
id: boiled-eggs-with-mayo
title: Boiled Eggs with Light Mayo
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 127

storage:
  fridge_days: 2
  freezer_friendly: false

---

In a #saucepan, cover @eggs{2%count} with cold water by an inch. Bring to a boil, then cook for ~boil{10%minute} until firm.

Drain, cool under cold water, and peel. Serve with @light-mayo{1%tbsp} for dipping.
